1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Fiftieth Episode
The Fortune Teller

15
00:02:07,021 --> 00:02:10,650
- Look. What is that over there?
- It's appearing out of nowhere!

16
00:02:17,821 --> 00:02:20,176
It's a type of tower
that we've never seen before.

17
00:02:20,221 --> 00:02:22,781
What a strange construction.
What could it mean?

18
00:02:22,821 --> 00:02:24,732
It's truly imposing.

19
00:02:33,501 --> 00:02:35,810
What could it mean?
It appeared so suddenly...

20
00:02:35,861 --> 00:02:38,773
- I think it's the work of magic.
- I think so too!

21
00:02:48,621 --> 00:02:51,658
Listen, Sire!
We've discovered what the tower is!

22
00:02:51,701 --> 00:02:53,612
It's an enormous Fortress
that Union X...

23
00:02:53,661 --> 00:02:55,891
...is building
on the territory of Goldland!

24
00:02:56,901 --> 00:02:59,461
- A Union X Fortress?!
- Good heavens!

25
00:02:59,501 --> 00:03:03,779
- My goodness, Union X!
- Something terrible is going to happen!

26
00:03:03,821 --> 00:03:05,937
If that is the
case, I fear it too!

27
00:03:06,941 --> 00:03:10,297
I understand! X intends
to occupy our Kingdom...

28
00:03:10,341 --> 00:03:12,332
...using the tower!
- It could be!

29
00:03:12,381 --> 00:03:14,770
It would be terrible! Union
X is capable of even that!

30
00:03:14,821 --> 00:03:17,176
- Oh, my God!
- Now I would like to know if the tower...

31
00:03:17,221 --> 00:03:19,610
...has already been completed.
- No, our observations...

32
00:03:19,661 --> 00:03:22,016
...show that the work
is still in progress, Sire!

33
00:03:22,101 --> 00:03:25,810
We must strengthen the defenses before
they complete the construction.

34
00:03:27,421 --> 00:03:30,333
I believe that tower
will decide the fate of Silverland!

35
00:03:55,141 --> 00:03:59,453
Damn Union X! I won't give you
my country without a fight!

36
00:04:18,501 --> 00:04:20,890
In Silverland
they are preparing defenses

37
00:04:22,621 --> 00:04:25,181
All this fussing
won't do them any good!

38
00:04:25,301 --> 00:04:28,691
When our tower is
completed, it will be over for them!

39
00:04:28,781 --> 00:04:31,056
- How much longer to finish the work?
- We are doing...

40
00:04:31,101 --> 00:04:34,377
...as fast as possible,
as you can see for yourself, boss!

41
00:04:41,941 --> 00:04:43,852
Come on! Move it!

42
00:04:45,541 --> 00:04:47,293
Faster!

43
00:04:47,341 --> 00:04:50,174
I asked when
the work will be completed!

44
00:04:50,621 --> 00:04:52,691
We don't have enough slaves,

45
00:04:52,741 --> 00:04:55,209
so it will take more time
than expected!

46
00:04:55,261 --> 00:04:58,378
You don't have enough slaves?
And why don't you get more?

47
00:04:58,421 --> 00:05:00,571
But boss...
there are no more!

48
00:05:00,661 --> 00:05:02,777
We are using
all the slaves from Goldland!

49
00:05:02,821 --> 00:05:04,857
Did you say "slaves from Goldland"?

50
00:05:06,821 --> 00:05:09,210
In front of us is Silverland.

51
00:05:09,421 --> 00:05:12,094
We will kidnap a hundred
of its inhabitants...

52
00:05:12,141 --> 00:05:14,416
...and we will force them
to work for us!

53
00:05:16,101 --> 00:05:18,456
Look at them struggling in vain!

54
00:05:20,461 --> 00:05:25,330
This is how Union X does
things! Go to Silverland!

55
00:05:49,221 --> 00:05:51,894
Look! Millions of birds
are darkening the sun!

56
00:06:10,421 --> 00:06:12,730
You say that citizens
have disappeared?

57
00:06:13,020 --> 00:06:15,979
Exactly, Princess!
A hundred people...

58
00:06:16,020 --> 00:06:19,013
...were enveloped by a
swarm of birds and vanished!

59
00:06:19,140 --> 00:06:21,814
Did you see where
those birds came from?

60
00:06:21,980 --> 00:06:23,972
No, but it is rumored that they cover...

61
00:06:24,020 --> 00:06:26,899
...an enormous giant
clad in iron armor!

62
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:36,972
I heard it said that the iron
giant is an evil spirit!

63
00:06:38,220 --> 00:06:40,371
They say that birds
will fill Silverland...

64
00:06:40,420 --> 00:06:43,413
...and that we will all be devoured
by the evil spirit!

65
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:51,012
Don't be foolish!

66
00:06:51,100 --> 00:06:53,490
I haven't been drinking! I assure you
that it's all true!

67
00:06:53,540 --> 00:06:55,452
Someone who never drinks
told me so!

68
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:58,095
He said he saw a giant
clad in black armor,

69
00:06:58,140 --> 00:07:00,177
crossing the sky
on a black horse!

70
00:07:09,740 --> 00:07:11,652
Who's there?

71
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:18,171
People, how about
having your fortunes told?

72
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:20,657
You ugly old hag,
stay away from me!

73
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:23,090
I don't believe in divination.
Go away!

74
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:27,617
There are bad omens
over your heads!

75
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:30,096
Soon you will see
the black birds arriving!

76
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:34,976
Be careful and don't
panic. It's no use!

77
00:07:35,020 --> 00:07:37,694
My omens
have never been wrong!

78
00:07:37,740 --> 00:07:39,572
Go away!

79
00:07:44,740 --> 00:07:47,778
Remember my words!
I am never wrong!

80
00:07:58,100 --> 00:08:00,615
Did you hear that jinx?

81
00:08:06,740 --> 00:08:08,697
Better go home, Tink!

82
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:11,414
What will you do if that giant
actually appears?

83
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,737
And what will you do, Sapphire?

84
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:17,969
I will fight! I will try to stop
him and save the Kingdom!

85
00:08:18,260 --> 00:08:20,297
Then I will fight with you too!

86
00:08:20,620 --> 00:08:23,738
But you are too small! At this
hour you should already be at home!

87
00:08:27,300 --> 00:08:30,134
I thought I saw something
pass under the bridge!

88
00:08:30,980 --> 00:08:33,017
Wait, I'm going to see!

89
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:39,892
Hey! Sapphire, what are you doing? Wait!

90
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:46,295
It's not fair! Why are you leaving
me here? Take me with you!

91
00:09:31,221 --> 00:09:35,578
Listen, I'm not afraid of just
any shadow! Anyway, I know...

92
00:09:49,021 --> 00:09:51,091
Three more monsters!

93
00:09:51,141 --> 00:09:53,701
- What happened to him?
- He must be crazy!

94
00:10:11,261 --> 00:10:13,092
Did you see?

95
00:10:16,421 --> 00:10:19,060
Look! This is the cat
that was with the fortune teller before!

96
00:10:19,101 --> 00:10:21,740
I recognize it!
Go away, you nasty cat!

97
00:10:25,181 --> 00:10:27,092
Look, a flock of birds.

98
00:10:27,141 --> 00:10:29,701
The fortune teller was right.
Let's run, quick!

99
00:10:39,501 --> 00:10:42,015
Hey, listen!
I think I hear something!

100
00:10:42,101 --> 00:10:44,217
It sounds like horse hooves!

101
00:10:44,461 --> 00:10:48,170
Help!
The ghost giant is coming!

102
00:11:08,741 --> 00:11:10,652
What is it?

103
00:11:15,581 --> 00:11:17,572
Damn, so many birds!

104
00:11:17,661 --> 00:11:19,936
This is the largest flock
I have ever seen!

105
00:11:20,021 --> 00:11:23,218
Where are you, ghost giant?
Come out!

106
00:11:25,581 --> 00:11:28,254
Opal, you stay here and don't move,
I'm counting on you!

107
00:11:29,821 --> 00:11:33,177
Come out, ghost giant,
accept a challenge from me!

108
00:11:33,221 --> 00:11:36,736
Come explain to me why
you kidnap the men of Silverland!

109
00:11:43,301 --> 00:11:45,292
Damn, it's huge!

110
00:11:46,941 --> 00:11:50,172
I won't allow you to enter
my country, ghost giant!

111
00:12:05,621 --> 00:12:08,419
Before I lose, I will resist
with all my strength!

112
00:12:09,341 --> 00:12:12,014
It's gone!
The ghost giant has disappeared!

113
00:12:25,341 --> 00:12:27,252
I can't breathe anymore!

114
00:12:56,541 --> 00:12:59,613
Sapphire, regain consciousness!
Please, my daughter!

115
00:12:59,661 --> 00:13:02,175
Thank goodness Opal caught her
and brought her back here,

116
00:13:02,221 --> 00:13:04,291
otherwise she would have died!

117
00:13:04,661 --> 00:13:08,051
I'm so worried about her..
What did the doctor say?

118
00:13:08,101 --> 00:13:10,012
He said he doesn't have
a sure remedy,

119
00:13:10,061 --> 00:13:13,098
because he has never seen
a poison like this in this country!

120
00:13:13,741 --> 00:13:16,414
Poor Sapphire!
How I wish I were in her place!

121
00:13:16,461 --> 00:13:18,611
Sapphire, wake up, please!

122
00:13:19,221 --> 00:13:22,133
Your Majesty,
hoping to please you,

123
00:13:22,181 --> 00:13:24,411
I thought of bringing you a fortune teller!

124
00:13:24,581 --> 00:13:27,857
You'll see that she will be
of some help to Sapphire as well!

125
00:13:28,141 --> 00:13:31,736
What do you think a fortune
teller can do for Sapphire?

126
00:13:31,941 --> 00:13:34,455
She will be able to see
good or bad omens...

127
00:13:34,501 --> 00:13:37,618
...in the Princess's destiny!
Come!

128
00:13:44,261 --> 00:13:47,810
You're all here, good! Good!

129
00:13:48,221 --> 00:13:50,655
Then I can begin!

130
00:13:54,541 --> 00:13:58,329
How frightening!
I'm sorry for her!

131
00:14:05,821 --> 00:14:10,975
This castle will be surrounded by a
thick black mist tomorrow evening!

132
00:14:11,021 --> 00:14:14,411
You will hear a sound
coming from inside this mist.

133
00:14:14,501 --> 00:14:17,095
A huge giant will arrive!

134
00:14:17,541 --> 00:14:19,736
And what will become of Sapphire? Tell us!

135
00:14:19,781 --> 00:14:23,694
The ghost giant will kidnap her!
No one will be able to prevent it,

136
00:14:23,741 --> 00:14:26,972
because if you resist,
there will be no escape for you!

137
00:14:27,021 --> 00:14:29,615
- Oh, good heavens, it's terrible!
- You will be annihilated!

138
00:14:30,461 --> 00:14:34,773
Did you hear? No one must be
in the path of the phantom giant!

139
00:14:34,821 --> 00:14:38,860
What a cruel fate! She will fall into the
hands of the giant while she sleeps!

140
00:14:38,901 --> 00:14:40,812
There is no way to prevent it!

141
00:14:55,621 --> 00:14:57,737
- My Sapphire...
- Quiet!

142
00:14:57,901 --> 00:15:01,291
We must keep it a secret that
Sapphire is no longer in this room.

143
00:15:01,341 --> 00:15:03,855
A secret, you say?
And you want no one to notice..

144
00:15:03,901 --> 00:15:06,290
..that she is no longer in there?
- Look!

145
00:15:07,981 --> 00:15:10,176
I will take Sapphire's place!

146
00:15:10,501 --> 00:15:14,130
- But you cannot do that, Your Majesty!
- I tried to dissuade her,

147
00:15:14,181 --> 00:15:16,695
but I didn't succeed!
That's why I sent for you!

148
00:15:16,741 --> 00:15:20,495
Then, if there is no other solution,
I will challenge the giant! I am ready!

149
00:15:20,541 --> 00:15:24,898
No, wait! It's better if you go
to X's castle, do you understand, Franz?

150
00:15:25,661 --> 00:15:28,619
It is said that the giant is moved
by a spirit from the castle.

151
00:15:28,661 --> 00:15:31,300
Perhaps the black mist will disappear
if that is destroyed!

152
00:15:31,341 --> 00:15:35,334
You can count on me, Queen! I
will tear down that damned castle!

153
00:15:36,101 --> 00:15:38,695
Sapphire, I will do
everything to protect you.

154
00:15:38,741 --> 00:15:42,177
For you I would even
cross the gates of hell!

155
00:15:42,221 --> 00:15:45,418
Wait for me with confidence and
just continue your sleep. I will win!

156
00:15:47,821 --> 00:15:49,812
Goodbye, Your Majesty!

157
00:15:51,661 --> 00:15:53,652
Be careful, Franz!

158
00:15:54,981 --> 00:15:57,973
I wish you with all my heart
to succeed in this endeavor!

159
00:16:35,341 --> 00:16:37,332
Oh, it's already night!

160
00:16:53,941 --> 00:16:58,412
- Help! Let's run!
- Let's run!

161
00:17:04,101 --> 00:17:06,092
What are these screams?

162
00:17:18,021 --> 00:17:21,093
The ghost giant the
fortune-teller spoke of!

163
00:17:38,141 --> 00:17:40,336
No one has noticed my presence!

164
00:17:44,701 --> 00:17:48,535
Come on, crows,
rise into the night sky!

165
00:17:52,021 --> 00:17:55,491
- Oh, Sapphire, you've recovered!
- What happened to me?

166
00:17:55,581 --> 00:17:59,415
Where am I? But this...
This is mother's room!

167
00:17:59,461 --> 00:18:03,170
- There's a reason why you're here!
- What?!

168
00:18:04,621 --> 00:18:08,614
Mother, where are
you? Mother! Mother!

169
00:18:15,501 --> 00:18:18,937
The ghost giant kidnapped her
just like the fortune teller said!

170
00:18:18,981 --> 00:18:22,735
- The ghost giant?
- You shouldn't have gotten up!

171
00:18:22,781 --> 00:18:24,612
You're still too weak!
You've been sick, you know?

172
00:18:24,661 --> 00:18:26,572
I must find the
strength to fight!

173
00:18:26,621 --> 00:18:29,499
- But you're still recovering!
- Damn X! Give me back my mother!

174
00:18:29,541 --> 00:18:32,294
See? I told you that you
haven't recovered yet!

175
00:18:33,501 --> 00:18:37,210
But you are the mysterious
knight and no longer Sapphire!

176
00:18:37,261 --> 00:18:40,219
Of course, Tink! I appeared
because I have a task to perform.

177
00:18:40,341 --> 00:18:42,218
Come, Tink!

178
00:18:44,021 --> 00:18:47,980
Damn X! I will succeed in taking
my mother from your clutches!

179
00:19:01,621 --> 00:19:03,737
There are only two guards.

180
00:19:13,621 --> 00:19:17,250
- Help, I can't see anything!
- Me neither! Help! Help!

181
00:19:22,261 --> 00:19:24,934
Your Excellency, here
is what I promised you!

182
00:19:25,861 --> 00:19:27,772
Well done!

183
00:19:29,901 --> 00:19:33,814
You've done a good job.
Now we have nothing to fear!

184
00:19:33,861 --> 00:19:37,331
- There's Sapphire!
- Damn! What an idiot you are!

185
00:19:37,381 --> 00:19:41,135
- This is the Queen of Silverland!
- Death and damnation! Indeed!

186
00:19:41,221 --> 00:19:44,975
This clever one was lying on the bed
instead of her daughter!

187
00:19:47,581 --> 00:19:51,256
- The bells are ringing!
- Alarm! There are enemies!

188
00:20:03,421 --> 00:20:05,332
Prince Franz!

189
00:20:07,381 --> 00:20:10,612
Drop your swords,
citizens of Goldland!

190
00:20:10,701 --> 00:20:13,932
Return to the prisons, slaves,

191
00:20:13,981 --> 00:20:16,211
or the Queen will be killed!

192
00:20:16,741 --> 00:20:18,732
Prince Franz!

193
00:20:18,821 --> 00:20:21,210
Throw your sword to the ground!
Or do you not care...

194
00:20:21,261 --> 00:20:24,617
...about what might happen
to the Queen of the neighboring country?

195
00:20:25,181 --> 00:20:28,014
It is unfair of you
to take a hostage!

196
00:20:29,141 --> 00:20:31,416
I will count to ten!

197
00:20:32,501 --> 00:20:34,492
One!

198
00:20:38,421 --> 00:20:41,015
What's happening?
But that's my mother!

199
00:20:43,101 --> 00:20:45,615
Three, four.

200
00:20:51,661 --> 00:20:53,538
Six!

201
00:20:57,341 --> 00:20:59,172
Nine!

202
00:21:01,741 --> 00:21:04,699
- Franz, don't worry about me.
- Ten!

203
00:21:04,821 --> 00:21:06,732
Wait, we surrender!

204
00:21:11,581 --> 00:21:14,618
You're a good Prince!
Now kill him,

205
00:21:14,661 --> 00:21:16,891
so that he may be an example
for the others!

206
00:21:22,941 --> 00:21:25,330
- The mysterious knight!
- What?!

207
00:21:25,421 --> 00:21:28,731
- Take this!
- Get lost, you brat!

208
00:21:28,821 --> 00:21:33,531
- Careful, Tink!
- A little brat like you certainly won't beat me!

209
00:21:33,701 --> 00:21:36,773
Come on!
Damn, you're sharp!

210
00:21:36,941 --> 00:21:41,332
Go to hell!

211
00:21:44,301 --> 00:21:46,769
- Dammit!
- Franz, take this!

212
00:21:46,821 --> 00:21:49,574
Thanks!
And now, it’s our turn!

213
00:21:50,901 --> 00:21:53,096
Damn, I didn't expect that!

214
00:21:53,221 --> 00:21:55,940
- For now, it's better to retreat!
- Wait, X!

215
00:21:56,501 --> 00:21:59,618
You royal pain in the ass, you'll
vanish along with the tower!

216
00:22:02,701 --> 00:22:05,135
Dammit! Where did he go?
I can't see him!

217
00:22:06,781 --> 00:22:10,490
- Franz, are you alright?
- Yes, I'm fine, but X has disappeared!

218
00:22:14,701 --> 00:22:16,737
Watch out! Let's get out of here, Franz!

219
00:22:16,781 --> 00:22:19,579
The tower is collapsing!
It's collapsing!

220
00:22:44,181 --> 00:22:46,172
Everyone escape, quickly!

221
00:22:47,421 --> 00:22:49,332
Quickly, Franz!

222
00:23:26,221 --> 00:23:28,940
X forced our people
to build the tower...

223
00:23:28,981 --> 00:23:31,700
...and he used the crows
to maneuver the giant!

224
00:23:31,741 --> 00:23:34,175
I'm heading to Silverland
at a run!

225
00:23:34,421 --> 00:23:37,970
See you soon, then!
We will follow you shortly. Is that alright?

226
00:23:40,341 --> 00:23:42,980
- Goodbye!
- Franz, if I see Sapphire,

227
00:23:43,021 --> 00:23:46,411
I will give her your regards!
And I'll tell her you'll see each other soon!

228
00:23:47,701 --> 00:23:50,738
Thank you, mysterious knight!
Goodbye and see you soon!

229
00:23:51,101 --> 00:23:53,979
Bye! Bye!

230
00:24:00,541 --> 00:24:03,692
Perhaps you thought
you could defeat me,

231
00:24:03,741 --> 00:24:06,016
but you won't succeed in doing so!

232
00:24:06,141 --> 00:24:08,132
I will never surrender!

233
00:24:10,821 --> 00:24:15,099
Next time will be the one
and I will destroy Silverland!

234
00:24:15,141 --> 00:24:17,132
Of that you can be sure!

235
